abstract: >
  Tello Vision is a modern, modular computer vision system for DJI Tello
  drones featuring real-time instance segmentation and object detection.
  Built on PyTorch with pluggable backends (YOLOv8, Detectron2), it provides
  5-6x performance improvement over legacy implementations, achieving 25-30 FPS
  on modern GPUs. The system includes a clean architecture with separate
  modules for detection, visualization, and drone control, making it ideal
  for research, education, and autonomous navigation applications.

